---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700">
      <p>By accessing NomadMatrix, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">1. Informational Purposes Only</h2>
      <p>NomadMatrix compiles immigration regulations, tax brackets, and cost metrics from publicly available embassy sites. While we strive to keep information accurate and up to date, immigration laws change frequently. None of the content on this website constitutes formal legal or tax counsel.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">2. Digital Products & Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>Our Pro Relocation & Tax Kits are delivered instantly upon completed checkout via Gumroad. We offer a 30-day money-back satisfaction guarantee on digital document packages.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6">3. External Links</h2>
      <p>Our pages contain references and links to government portals and third-party partners. We do not assume responsibility for third-party terms or content outside our domain.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
